title: ESXi Datastore File Destruction
id: bf969258-1995-4369-bc87-ac35b270b09d
status: experimental
description: Detects destructive operations against ESXi datastore files (rm of vmdk/vmx in /vmfs/volumes, or esxcli storage filesystem operations), a data-destruction technique targeting virtual machine disks on the hypervisor.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1485/
logsource:
  product: linux
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    CommandLine|contains: '/vmfs/volumes/'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'rm '
      - '.vmdk'
      - '.vmx'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Administrators decommissioning VMs
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1485
